      "description": "<p><em><strong>It looks like a child drew this gun - Comment from a certain individual</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Howa Type 64, a rifle that is well known both in media and the JSDF, is chambered in 7.62 Nato rounds. Although it’s supposed to use a modified cartridges with lower gunpowder, locals seems to use regular ones. Oh yeah 30 of them were lost, but i guess that doesn’t matter since it somehow ended up here.</p>\n<p><em><strong>How did this get into a slavic country, like genuinely how, who on gods earth smuggled this here.</strong></em></p>\n<p>Can be bought from Mechanic LL1 (Most of it are in euro or barter)</p>\n<p>Requested by Rena-Chan</p>\n<p>&lt;iframe width=“560” height=“315” src=“https://www.youtube.com/embed/UP1aftg6rDg?si=PwwTPZzuRkoKZ4Bn” title=“YouTube video player” frameborder=“0” allow=“accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share” referrerpolicy=“strict-origin-when-cross-origin” allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; Animation by me</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/gun/howa-type-64-japanese-battle-rifle-with-m1-bayonet\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Model</a> By <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/designers/8siandude\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">8sianDude</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instruction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Download the Zip from the Gdrive</p>\n<p>2. Open the Zip</p>\n<p>3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder</p>\n<p>4. Enjoy</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wMIskD3.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wMIskD3.gif\" alt=\"wMIskD3.gif\" /></a></p></div></div></div>\n<p><em>P.S You ever been held at gun point by a crazy lady?</em></p>\n",
